{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119949","id":3783577316,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hhM7k","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119949","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119949.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119949.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119949","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119949/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119949/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119949/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b47eaeb19bffd7f7fcdb3e22dad6999597a9c65b","number":119949,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Wayland / X11 drag files support","user":{"login":"userhaj","id":28493440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDkzNDQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28493440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj","html_url":"https://github.com/userhaj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/userhaj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes  https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/50\r\n\r\nCreates Window.drag_files()\r\nImplements new drag_files method in X11 and Wayland display servers\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nDrag and drop functionality manually tested with gdscript:\r\n```GDScript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar drag_files: PackedStringArray\r\n\r\n# First drag drop any files from an OS file browser\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tget_window().files_dropped.connect(files_to_drag)\r\n\r\nfunc files_to_drag(files):\r\n\tdrag_files = files\r\n\tprint(\"Files Dropped:\")\r\n\tprint(files)\r\n\t\r\n# Then click and drag anywhere on Godot app to drag away files\r\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\r\n\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\r\n\t\tif event.is_pressed():\r\n\t\t\tprint(\"GDScript Start Drag\")\r\n\t\t\tget_window().drag_files(drag_files)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n> AI was used to understand dnd and search for dnd documentation\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbs